  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>双持巨剑</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是Epicfight模组的附加内容。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它允许你双持巨剑！</span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003973381231755384/2022-08-02_12.21.20.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你只需要学习被动技能书，就能获得一套新的4种双持自动攻击、3种双手自动攻击、新的冲刺攻击、新的跳跃攻击和新的特殊攻击！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">还有新的威胁性闲置、行走和跑步动画。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003976679363969034/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"378\"><br>享受并玩得开心！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">原创意来自Ralf ^^。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（为了与Minecraft武器Patreon兼容，请确保[mod:efdg]（双持巨剑数据包）在[mod:wom]（Minecraft武器数据包）和[mod:epicfight]（Epicfight数据包）之间，就像这样：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003973485376323685/efdgWomCompat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"623\" height=\"65\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
